&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INTOXICATE MYSTIQUE&lt;/strong&gt; by La Fede — 100 ML Extrait de Parfum&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An aura of power and mystery. Intoxicate Mystique is a bold and sophisticated Extrait de Parfum for men, crafted in an intense concentration for exceptional longevity and commanding presence. It opens with the refined freshness of bergamot and musk — sharp and immediately captivating. The heart reveals geranium accord and guaiac wood — a rich woody-floral balance exuding strength and confidence. The base settles into Siam benzoin, vanilla, and balsamic accords — smooth, resinous, and beautifully lasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fragrance Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Top: Bergamot, Musk&lt;br&gt;
Heart: Geranium Accord, Guaiac Wood&lt;br&gt;
Base: Siam Benzoin, Vanilla, Balsam&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Extrait de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Men&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Brand:&lt;/strong&gt; La Fede by Khadlaj&lt;/p&gt;
